    },
    "Drakn Sisters": {"output": "Sovereign Territories", 
      "status": "active",
      "role": "UAT: batch workspace for all ten sisters: every stage (poses, motion, armor, clothing, showcase, scenes, video), laid out stage first (stage/family/Hero) so one stage across all sisters sits together. Each sister's own workspace holds the same work for fine tuning."
